mergers and acquisitions are one of the  most important means by which companies  respond to changing economic and  financial conditions it has become one  of the favourite exit strategies for  many entrepreneurs and startups  especially here in Silicon Valley  the unfortunate reality however is that  the majority of M&amp;A transactions fail to  provide the benefits that companies  predict or expect to gain this time for  GSP mergers and acquisition program is  an interdisciplinary overview of all the  major aspects of M&amp;A transactions I  wanted to attend a program to better  understand how different companies and  different industries go through the  acquisition process from strategy to  integration that gives you exposure to a  lot of deals and a lot of thinking I've  had different levels of M&amp;A experience  what this program was able to do for me  was have that entire lifecycle talk  about it with people who have had  different experiences and help my  company develop our core strategy one of  the keys to a success of an M&amp;A  transaction is understanding the  perspective in the mindset of the person  on the other side the negotiation class  helps solidify the concepts in a very  practical manner and doing case studies  outside of what you're comfortable with  is very very powerful  so the program offers participants an  opportunity to get immersed in an  intense yet very collaborative learning  environments our goal is really to  provide program participants with  critical insights and powerful tools  that will help them more successfully  formulate and execute emerges an  acquisition strategy they can really  create value for their organizations  people like me who've done a lot of  acquisitions already that the benefit is  just kind of sharpening your skills  thinking differently the program is  something that I'm taking back into my  organization day one
 

